{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bat has a <strong>VERY</strong> strange quirk...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He can only turn around by smacking his face into walls.<br>This will make saving the world somewhat <i>difficult</i>, but someone's gotta do it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>Super easy to play... <strong>and darn hard to beat</strong>, flap your way to the top of 5 punishingly-addicting levels while earning achievements, setting leaderboard times, and unlocking the many gameplay-earned cosmetic items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make no mistake, <i>this is a rage game</i>, but It's not <strong>nearly as punishing</strong> as other rage games because the levels are so much shorter and you can regain your progress very quickly.<br> <br>Oh, and showing it to a friend and watching them rage is pretty entertaining.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"500 Flaps - Crystal Cave","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2021390/77b21455f5a9d2c7561ca4f850aec81679276688.jpg"},{"name":"1000 Flaps - Crystal Cave","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2021390/77b21455f5a9d2c7561ca4f850aec81679276688.jpg"},{"name":"2500 Flaps - Crystal Cave","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2021390/77b21455f5a9d2c7561ca4f850aec81679276688.jpg"},{"name":"5000 Flaps - Crystal Cave","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2021390/77b21455f5a9d2c7561ca4f850aec81679276688.jpg"},{"name":"100m Fall - Crystal Cave","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2021390/77b21455f5a9d2c7561ca4f850aec81679276688.jpg"},{"name":"200m Fall - Crystal Cave","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2021390/77b21455f5a9d2c7561ca4f850aec81679276688.jpg"},{"name":"50m Frog Fall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/20213